{
  "name": "Experimental Elixir",
  "type": "feat",
  "_id": "gipp6i2SwxyssGeb",
  "img": "icons/consumables/potions/bottle-round-corked-orange.webp",
  "folder": "6KgsSF7UP48Nfsd6",
  "sort": 200000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you finish a Long Rest while holding Alchemist's Supplies, you can use them to magically produce two elixirs. For each, roll on the Experimental Elixir table to determine its effect, which is triggered when someone drinks it. The elixir appears in a vial that vanishes when the elixir is drunk or poured out; any elixir left when you finish a Long Rest vanishes with its vial.</p><p><strong>Drinking an Elixir.</strong> As a Bonus Action, a creature can drink the elixir or give it to another creature within 5 feet of itself.</p><p><strong>Creating Additional Elixirs.</strong> As a Magic action while holding Alchemist's Supplies, you can expend a spell slot to create another elixir, choosing its effect from the table instead of rolling.</p><p>At certain Artificer levels, you make more elixirs at the end of each Long Rest: three at level 5, four at level 9, and five at level 15.</p><h4>Experimental Elixir</h4><table><thead><tr><th>1d6</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Healing.</strong> The drinker regains Hit Points equal to 2d8 plus your Intelligence modifier; this increases by 1d8 at Artificer levels 9 (3d8) and 15 (4d8).</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Swiftness.</strong> The drinker's Speed increases by 10 feet for 1 hour; the bonus increases at Artificer levels 9 (15 feet) and 15 (20 feet).</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Resilience.</strong> The drinker gains a +1 bonus to AC for 10 minutes; the duration increases at Artificer levels 9 (1 hour) and 15 (8 hours).</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Boldness.</strong> The drinker can roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to every attack roll and saving throw it makes for the next minute; the duration increases at Artificer levels 9 (10 minutes) and 15 (1 hour).</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Flight.</strong> The drinker gains a Fly Speed of 10 feet for 10 minutes; it increases at Artificer levels 9 (20 feet) and 15 (30 feet).</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Choice.</strong> You choose the elixir's effect from the other rows of this table.</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Jm9r6Wg0ok9uNWdT\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The uses are your elixirs. <em>Roll Elixir</em> rolls the table; each drink activity spends an elixir and applies its effect. <em>Create Elixir</em> spends a spell slot: restore one use yourself.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
